  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c126a01f56ee07b6cda71b1f11702200018b0f5d?download\" data-file-name=\"ar 운동.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2203604\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D573%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20230508163833&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fc126a01f56ee07b6cda71b1f11702200018b0f5d')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">ar 운동</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">2.10MB</div></div></a></div><p>안녕하세요!</p><p>3단원 &#39;운동과 에너지&#39; 첫 단원을 들어가는 데,</p><p>아무래도 행사가 많은 5월 (체험학습을 앞둔...)이다보니 아이들이 집중력도 떨어지고</p><p>저도 계속 뭔가를 미루게 되어서 (?)</p><p>컨텐츠를 찾던 중 좋은 걸 발견하여 소개해 드립니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/58fe1ab3e3626b793582e29eab0f6e344d26446b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/58fe1ab3e3626b793582e29eab0f6e344d26446b\" data-origin-width=\"1843\" data-origin-height=\"845\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>앱스토어, 구글 플레이에서 다운로드 가능하구요!</p><p>몇몇 친구들의 스마트기기(저희 학교 크롬북 ㅠ)는 호환이 안된다고 합니다...</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c6dd18b08b5f149ac43a0e9f98eba1bf8608cc1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c6dd18b08b5f149ac43a0e9f98eba1bf8608cc1\" data-origin-width=\"654\" data-origin-height=\"111\"></div><p>첨부된 파일과 사진들을 보며 직접 체험 후</p><p>아이들에게 소개해주시면</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>아이들이 안 자고 잠깐! 재밌어 합니다 ㅎㅎ&#160;</b></span></p><p>동시에, <span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>속력에 대한 개념도 잘 알려줄 수도 있구요!</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>아이들의 화면이 작다보니, <span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><b>제 핸드폰을 미러링하여 다시 큰 TV에 공유해서 수업을 해볼까 합니다!</b></span></p><p>참고하세요~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74a9e09e15f6d8b0c07336b7c7e07ebe941eb99f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74a9e09e15f6d8b0c07336b7c7e07ebe941eb99f\" data-origin-width=\"794\" data-origin-height=\"1123\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a22c45e7c1d18b3fcd34dfa210cda6648d589b6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7a22c45e7c1d18b3fcd34dfa210cda6648d589b6\" data-origin-width=\"794\" data-origin-height=\"1123\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07702953eeada7cad2cafedcd35a00517c6295d3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/07702953eeada7cad2cafedcd35a00517c6295d3\" data-origin-width=\"794\" data-origin-height=\"1123\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/09f2c0c11fc4b183b84d8595bd808d8f0488ffea\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/09f2c0c11fc4b183b84d8595bd808d8f0488ffea\" data-origin-width=\"794\" data-origin-height=\"1123\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/901ee3e9b4923c8c26f83f30d729d1408b0648ee\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/901ee3e9b4923c8c26f83f30d729d1408b0648ee\" data-origin-width=\"794\" data-origin-height=\"1123\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e23b3d4185f544ae790a077abcd6a59872619882\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e23b3d4185f544ae790a077abcd6a59872619882\" data-origin-width=\"794\" data-origin-height=\"1123\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
